       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="autoShowMatricesOnOpenCheckBox">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Auto-show error &amp;&amp; template matrices on open</string>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>When checked, opening a document automatically creates a Grouping Assistant Display with both the Error Matrix and Template Matrix docks, then triggers an Update Error Matrix to populate them.  Saves the user from manually doing this on every document open.  Combines with the global window-geometry restore (already saved on close) to give a consistent layout across sessions.</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item row="4" column="0">
       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="templateXcorrPearsonCheckBox">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Mean-subtract waveforms before template &amp;xcorr (Pearson)</string>
        </property>
        <property name="toolTip">
         <string>When checked, each cluster mean waveform has its overlap-window mean removed before the normalised cross-correlation, so the Template Matrix (and auto-merge) measure shape correlation (Pearson) instead of cosine similarity.  Removes sensitivity to a shared DC offset between templates.  Off by default (plain cosine).</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
